  money: ['M50 14 C70 14 86 30 86 50 C86 70 70 86 50 86 C30 86 14 70 14 50 C14 30 30 14 50 14 Z', 'M62 36 C58 30 40 30 40 40 C40 52 62 46 62 60 C62 70 44 72 38 64', 'M50 24 L50 76'],
